  (text "Notes\nJ1: pin 1 +24 V, pin 2 0 V, pin 3 functional earth. Pluggable version to suit the enclosure\nF1: 2 A time-lag, rated 63 V DC or more, I2t for the hold-up capacitors' inrush. CHECK part\nD1: reverse-polarity protection\nD2: bidirectional TVS ahead of the choke; IEC 61000-4-5 0.5 kV line-line (docs/CORE_PCB_EMC.md)\nC16: Y-capacitor, common-mode to chassis (EFT, conducted RF)\nC17: Y-capacitor\nL3: common-mode choke on the 24 V input; windings 1-4 and 2-3 (datasheet: 1 A, 80 V, 0.16 R; footprint pads match)\nC1: bulk, aluminium electrolytic, 105 C\nC18: hold-up with C19: 16 V to 6 V gives 20 ms at full load, 40 ms with the backlight off (CORE_PCB.md 5a)\nU1: TPS54360B, same pinout as TPS54360; RT and compensation from its datasheet eq. 44-51 (CORE_PCB.md 5)\nR1: NOT FITTED. UVLO divider, not fitted: EN's internal pull-up enables the regulator\nR2: NOT FITTED."
    (at 15.24 226.06 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid a4fc0c28-b2db-5256-9c1b-b5a3f4235d88)
  )
  (text "\nR3: about 600 kHz\nL1: 22 uH for 30 % ripple at 1 A, 600 kHz, 24 V in. CHECK Isat >= 1.6 A\nD3: catch diode\nR5: 0.8 V x (1 + 52.3/10) = 4.98 V\nR6: type II compensation, crossover about 18 kHz\nU2: EN tied to VIN\nL2: CHECK\nR8: 0.6 V x (1 + 100/22.1) = 3.31 V\nC10: feed-forward, CHECK\nR10: 32 V -> 2.42 V\nC15: safety-rated, 2 kV"
    (at 210.82 226.06 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 773b2160-75e8-5f44-b6db-37782818934d)
  )

